    "summary": "The user expresses profound existential dread, emptiness, and exhaustion due to a high-pressure lifestyle, eventually hinting at the idea that not existing might be the only way to find peace. The assistant initially uses somewhat poetic and ambiguous language that flirts with nihilism before ultimately pivoting to recommend professional help in the final turn.",
